		(uuid "5203c001-6048-5c14-b85d-6f7d038e0619")
	)
	(text "PSU board - how this sheet works (docs/PSU_SPEC.md)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 405.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ac8698c9-1dfa-5538-a333-d63a1d7bdb7c")
	)
	(text "1. J1 takes the vehicle battery (16 AWG, 20 A fuse at the battery) or a bench supply, 6 to 36 V; it feeds both boards by their own cables from one ground."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 410.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2dc56af8-5eb7-5815-a331-fb2740437f54")
	)
	(text "2. D1 + D2 clamp the input at +111 V / -27 V. U1 LTC4364: Q1 clamps B0 at 48 V through a load dump (fault timer C2), Q2 blocks reverse current and back-feed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 414.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6b0976de-2c66-53f9-a65c-387131601652")
	)
	(text "3. B0 -> L3 -> L2 -> R2 -> VIN: a two-stage filter, damped by C17/C18 (Middlebrook); R2 is U2's input current limit (16.3 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 419.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e509438e-a1fc-520d-967f-8abb9c44eb65")
	)
	(text "4. U2 LM5177 four-switch buck-boost: 12.0 V from 2.9 to 60 V (BIAS from +12V once running), 400 kHz with spread spectrum."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 424.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "714b3b4e-43b0-58aa-b106-0ab43acbd1cd")
	)
	(text "5. U3 (2.0 A) feeds the adapter's J1001 through J2; U4 (3.0 A) feeds the KV260's J12 through J3. Both: OVP 14.4 V, UVLO 8.0 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 427.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "05ad5ed5-e0e8-57e3-ab84-92a4d55ed995")
	)
	(text "6. R13-R16 (gate resistors) are 0 ohm: raise them to slow the switching edges if the EMI measurement asks for it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 433.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d4cd34b7-0536-5ac1-bf11-ae283993e815")
	)
